sequenceDiagram
    participant Member
    participant ReactApp
    participant EnrollAPI
    participant Database

    Member->>ReactApp: Click Enrol Now
    ReactApp->>EnrollAPI: POST /api/enrollments
    EnrollAPI->>Database: Begin transaction
    EnrollAPI->>Database: Check credit balance
    alt Insufficient credits
        EnrollAPI-->>ReactApp: 400 Bad Request
        ReactApp-->>Member: Show error message
    else Sufficient credits
        EnrollAPI->>Database: Insert CreditTransaction
        EnrollAPI->>Database: Update User.CreditBalance
        EnrollAPI->>Database: Insert Enrollment
        EnrollAPI->>Database: Increment session count
        EnrollAPI->>Database: Commit
        EnrollAPI-->>ReactApp: 201 Created
        ReactApp-->>Member: Success redirect My Programs
    end
